Modifications made for this vendored port:

- ported the reachable source surface to Lean and Mathlib v4.32.1;
- removed the unlicensed `informal` package dependency and its annotations;
- omitted seven modules unreachable from the consuming library, including the
  only module containing a real `sorry` declaration;
- omitted upstream development-agent instructions, build caches, scripts, and
  unrelated repository artifacts from the vendored distribution; and
- component-qualified the otherwise duplicate `SpectralObject.mapHomologicalFunctor`
  declaration so it can coexist with CohLean's independent implementation; and
- added narrow linter annotations where public API names must remain stable.

No Apache-2.0 copyright or licence header was removed from retained source.
